    {
      "title": "Revision and exam focus",
      "html": "<p>Revise the whole topic by working through its key points in order, then test yourself with the 50-question quiz for this topic. Pay attention to definitions, differences between similar terms, and questions that ask you to apply the topic rather than only recall it.</p><h4>Worked examples</h4><p><b>Q:</b> Meaning of <i>a wolf in sheep's clothing</i>:<br/><b>A:</b> a dangerous person appearing harmless \u2014 Deceptive appearance.</p><p><b>Q:</b> Meaning of <i>bite the bullet</i>:<br/><b>A:</b> bear pain bravely \u2014 Accept difficulty.</p><p><b>Q:</b> Meaning of <i>call it a day</i>:<br/><b>A:</b> stop working \u2014 Finish for the day.</p>",
